 "size": 8120155,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.6,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "欢迎回来。这是今天的第三期，来一条科技新闻，主角是芯片巨头英伟达。"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.21,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "上周，英伟达的创始人黄仁勋突然辞职。他掌管这家公司三十三年，这次是因为一桩私人丑闻，还牵涉到美国的国家安全调查。公司让财务总监克雷斯临时接班。"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.06,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "本周二晚上，英伟达交出了没有黄仁勋之后的第一份季度成绩单。结果很亮眼：一个季度收入大约一千一百六十亿美元，比去年同期翻了一倍还多，也明显高于分析师的预测。"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.59,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "同一天，董事会主席明确表示，不打算让黄仁勋回来。这类公司财报新闻，英语的关键词是："
  },
  {
   "start": 54.88,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "quarterly results."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.78,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 59.95,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Quartalszahlen."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.98,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "字面意思就是：季度的数字。"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.99,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "开始之前，先复习上一期的两个词。彻底改革、大修。"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.32,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.6,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "grundlegend umbauen."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.1,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "削弱、暗中破坏。"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.72,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "undermine."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.99,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "untergraben."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.51,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "今天学五个词。我们开始。"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.38,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第一个，是一个短语。"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.4,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "step down."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.89,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "step down."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.29,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "重音落在后面这个小词上。"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.83,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "step DOWN."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.32,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是辞职、卸任，从领导的位置上下来。比直接说辞职更委婉，新闻里非常常见。后面常接一个介词，说明从什么职位上下来："
  },
  {
   "start": 128.93,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "step down as chief executive.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 133.74,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "step down as chief executive.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 138.55,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "step down as chief executive.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 142.1,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "辞去首席执行官的职务。"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.7,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是一个可分动词："
  },
  {
   "start": 148.69,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "zurücktreten."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.0,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "名词是："
  },
  {
   "start": 154.18,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Rücktritt."
  },
  {
   "start": 157.37,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里，英语这样说："
  },
  {
   "start": 160.48,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Huang stepped down as Nvidia's chief executive last week.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 167.59,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Huang stepped down as Nvidia's chief executive last week.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 174.71,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Huang stepped down as Nvidia's chief executive last week.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 179.99,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "黄仁勋上周辞去了英伟达首席执行官的职务。"
  },
  {
   "start": 185.44,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这样说："
  },
  {
   "start": 187.61,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Huang ist vergangene Woche als Konzernchef zurückgetreten.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 195.95,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Huang ist vergangene Woche als Konzernchef zurückgetreten.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 204.29,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Huang ist vergangene Woche als Konzernchef zurückgetreten.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 210.48,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "黄仁勋上周辞去了集团总裁的职务。"
  },
  {
   "start": 215.19,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "生活里："
  },
  {
   "start": 217.36,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "She stepped down as team leader to spend more time with her family.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 224.67,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "She stepped down as team leader to spend more time with her family.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 231.98,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "She stepped down as team leader to spend more time with her family.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 237.38,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "她辞去了组长的职务，想多陪陪家人。"
  },
  {
   "start": 241.9,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：一位老板从讲台的台阶上一步一步走下来，把位置让给别人。英语是往下迈一步；德语前半部分是往回，后半部分是迈步，就是往后退一步。一个往下，一个往后，都是离开那个位置。"
  },
  {
   "start": 262.26,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 264.53,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "step down."
  },
  {
   "start": 269.42,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "zurücktreten."
  },
  {
   "start": 275.14,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第二个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 277.41,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "interim."
  },
  {
   "start": 279.88,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "interim."
  },
  {
   "start": 282.25,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "注意，重音在第一个音节。"
  },
  {
   "start": 285.67,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "IN-te-rim, interim."
  },
  {
   "start": 288.94,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是临时的、过渡期的。正式的人选或者方案还没定下来之前，先顶上去的那个，就用这个词。新闻里最常见的搭配是："
  },
  {
   "start": 302.44,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "interim CEO."
  },
  {
   "start": 305.05,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "临时首席执行官。还有："
  },
  {
   "start": 309.12,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "an interim solution."
  },
  {
   "start": 312.11,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "临时的解决办法。德语最常用的说法是："
  },
  {
   "start": 317.19,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "vorübergehend."
  },
  {
   "start": 320.76,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是暂时地。德语新闻里，克雷斯的头衔也常写成："
  },
  {
   "start": 327.64,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Interimschefin."
  },
  {
   "start": 331.53,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里，英语这样说："
  },
  {
   "start": 334.64,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Finance chief Colette Kress is now running Nvidia as interim CEO.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 343.38,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Finance chief Colette Kress is now running Nvidia as interim CEO.",
   "rep": 2
